  "id": "the-dragoning",
  "title": "The Dragoning",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Trigger Warning: Men in Peril! In this award-winning* audio dramedy, the world is shaken by the transformations of women into dragons who consume and immolate men. Season 1: A tourist from afar tries to understand what, when any woman could literally eat you for lunch, is a guy supposed to do? Who can you trust? Season 2: The tourist creates an international incident by bringing home a dragon. Season 3: Dragon fame brings new opportunities, forms and enemies. * Produced by Messenger Theatre Company, a 501c3 in NYC Start with Season 1, Episode 1 *Best Audio Series of All Genres -LAWeb Fest",
